# acl - per-user topic permissions (installed as /etc/mosquitto/acl).
# Topics: spec.md §6.1 / cloud/dashboard/mqtt_topics.js. Each user can only
# do its own half of the conversation, so a leaked dashboard password can't
# spoof telemetry and a leaked robot password can't drive the robot.

user robot1
topic read robot/robot1/drive
topic write robot/robot1/telemetry

user dashboard
topic write robot/robot1/drive
topic read robot/robot1/telemetry
